  "arrangerNotes": "Verse 1, verified against the LilyPond score on German Wikipedia (German note names). Beamed eighth pairs carry one syllable over two notes. No simplification needed. D drum: as written (range 1 to high 3), D minLayout 13. C drum: the C drum has no high 2/3, so the high part of 'Die Gedanken sind frei' and of 'Sie fliegen vorbei' and the whole second half ('Kein Mensch kann sie wissen' to the end) are played one octave lower; C minLayout 11. C and D arrangements differ where noted above (each fits its own drum).",
  "verified": true
